---
---

<section class="cierre grain" id="cierre">
  <div class="bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/images/silueta-neural.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.08" />
  </div>
  <div class="container cierre-inner">
    <p class="lab" data-reveal>10 — Cierre</p>
    <h2 class="display" data-reveal>Bienvenido a <em>Primate.</em></h2>
    <p data-reveal>
      Hay cosas que conoces. Cosas que crees conocer. Y todo lo que todavía no descubriste. Tu
      territorio te espera.
    </p>
    <div class="actions" data-reveal>
      <a href="#productos" class="btn btn-ember">Explorar la colección</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cierre {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 10rem) 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -12% 0;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  .bg img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .bg::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(70% 80% at 50% 50%, transparent 15%, var(--void) 92%);
  }
  .cierre-inner {
    position: relative;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
    margin: 1rem auto 1.25rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h2 em {
    color: var(--ember);
  }
  p {
    color: var(--muted-on-dark);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2.25rem;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
